`),factIds:["F-01","F-02","F-03","P-01","P-02","V-01"],toneNote:"Matches FINCALIBRE_BRAND_CREATIVE_PROFILE_V1.md — explain and orient; product first; no urgency."},{id:"trust_discipline",headline:"Trust built on restraint, not noise",lane:"Trust / discipline",body:["FinCalibre uses calm, direct language, centers your agency, and avoids hype, shame, or engineering-first framing as the primary consumer story. Value stays framed as decisions you keep ownership of—not as promised returns, personalized advice outcomes, rankings, or “best / #1” claims.","For producer-linked data in Kinex, identity linkage stays optional and explicit: when a producer supplies person_id_by_user_id, keys must match owner_shells[].user_id, values must be Kinex public.persons.id UUIDs, and invalid shapes are rejected; when that map is omitted, Kinex does not infer a person link. Optional shell sections (profile, app_settings, buffer_config, user_routing_state, buckets) are stored as opaque JSON. Structural owner intelligence reflects configured presence and provenance (and, when buckets is a JSON array, element count only)—not semantic interpretation of inner shell contents."].join(`

`),factIds:["F-05","F-03","T-01","T-02","H-02"],toneNote:"Matches brand profile — consumer trust first; technical discipline second, within the facts contract."},{id:"how_it_works",headline:"Free to use, straightforward to judge",lane:"How it works",body:["FinCalibre is free to use so you can judge the product on its merits. Default messaging favors try, learn, and see over purchase urgency, paid-unlock pressure, or scarcity tied to buying. Value stays grounded in easier reasoning about your money situation and decisions you keep—not in promised returns or similar blocked claim shapes.","For producers using Kinex in Phase 1, intake is POST /api/fincalibre/intake with the documented secret header and JSON body (brand_slug, snapshot.owner_shells). The path validates owner_shells with non-empty user_id strings and persists each full shell as JSON; Kinex does not infer a Kinex person_id unless the producer supplies person_id_by_user_id with valid UUIDs for keys present in the snapshot. Each successful intake records a run, stores a full raw snapshot for forensic review, and upserts durable per-owner rows, including structural intelligence fields—supporting an auditable trail inside Kinex."].join(`

`),factIds:["F-04","F-03","K-01","K-02","H-01","V-02"],toneNote:"Free-product posture first; short factual Kinex support second; no performance or outcome language."},{id:"review_first_cta",headline:"Calm next steps: learn, export, review",lane:"Review-first CTA",body:["Keep messaging in the try / learn / see lane: calm and direct, user agency forward, and review-first—without implying publish or send from Kinex itself. Operators can read structural FinCalibre owner intelligence in Kinex at /fincalibre-owner-intelligence (scoped to brands.slug = 'fincalibre'). Operators can assemble and export a bounded, review-first content package at /fincalibre-bounded-content-output using the Kinex module that builds the plain-text bundle.","Suggested CTAs (allowed shapes — read / export / internal next step):","• Open docs/FINCALIBRE_CONTENT_FACTS_CONTRACT_V1.md and confirm which rows apply before sharing externally.","• Open docs/FINCALIBRE_CONTENT_CATEGORIES_AND_CTA_RULES_V1.md and stay within Category A CTAs until categories expand.","• From /fincalibre-bounded-content-output, copy the full package or the outward readout for an internal review pass—not a go-live."].join(`
